# Safar Hazara: API list

Frontend backend se in addresses (endpoints) par baat karega. Jawab JSON format mein aayega.

## Auth
| Method | Address | Kaam | Kaun |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | /auth/register | Naya account banana | Sab |
| POST | /auth/login | Login karke token lena | Sab |
| GET | /auth/me | Apni maloomat dekhna | Login user |

## Destinations
| Method | Address | Kaam | Kaun |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | /destinations | Sab destinations ki list | Sab |
| GET | /destinations/{slug} | Ek destination ki detail | Sab |
| POST | /destinations | Naya destination add karna | Admin |
| PUT | /destinations/{id} | Destination edit karna | Admin |
| DELETE | /destinations/{id} | Destination hatana | Admin |

## Hotels
| Method | Address | Kaam | Kaun |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | /hotels | Hotels ki list (destination_id se filter ho sakti hai) | Sab |
| GET | /hotels/{id} | Ek hotel ki detail | Sab |
| POST | /hotels | Naya hotel add karna | Admin |
| PUT | /hotels/{id} | Hotel edit karna | Admin |
| DELETE | /hotels/{id} | Hotel hatana | Admin |

## Trip list (hafta 4)
| Method | Address | Kaam | Kaun |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | /my-trip | Meri saved jagahein | Login user |
| POST | /my-trip/{destination_id} | Jagah trip mein add karna | Login user |
| DELETE | /my-trip/{destination_id} | Jagah trip se hatana | Login user |

## Qaide
- Admin wale addresses par backend role check karega. Tourist ko 403 milega.
- Login ke baad milne wala token har request ke saath jayega.